<title>USA: Douglas Cty, Wash., seeks tender offers on deal.</title>
<headline>Douglas Cty, Wash., seeks tender offers on deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barr Brothers &amp; Co., Inc. as agent, will be accepting tender offers on the following Douglas County, Wash., P.U.D.#1, Wells Hydroelectric revenue bonds:</p>
<p>--Series 1963  4.00% due 9/1/18 259561AV0</p>
<p>--Series 1965  3.70% due 9/1/18 259561AU2</p>
<p>Tenders will be accepted Monday 5/5/97 from 1100 EDT to 1300 EDT for settlement 5/8/97.</p>
<p>The Authority reserves the right to reject any or all offers. Please contact Bob Zmuidins at 212-363-4090 or fax to 212-269-7637.</p>
</text>
